OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAreas of fog, locally dense,
OL,6,Fwill slowly clear this morning. Then
OL,7,Fremaining dry for many places, with
OL,8,Fvarying amounts of cloud but also some
OL,9,Fsunny spells. However, showers will
OL,10,Freach some southern coastal areas,
OL,11,Fperhaps temporarily pushing a little
OL,12,Finland.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear periods, with showers
OL,15,Falong the south coast mostly fading
OL,16,Faway. Areas of fog will quickly form
OL,17,Fthis evening, becoming locally dense.
OL,18,FTemperatures falling near freezing in
OL,19,Fsome rural locations.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
