OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAreas of fog, locally dense,
OL,6,Fwill gradually lift through the
OL,7,Fmorning to leave largely dry
OL,8,Fconditions with sunny spells and light
OL,9,Fwinds. However, isolated south coast
OL,10,Fshowers are still possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,13,FMonday and Tuesday with variable cloud
OL,14,Fand sunny spells, once any overnight
OL,15,Ffog clears Monday morning. Wednesday
OL,16,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain.
OL,17,FTemperatures near average with
OL,18,Fgenerally light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
